Production UI (#108, ADR-0013). The platform has one light appearance: dark and system modes, stored or requested,
resolve to light in ThemeProvider and in index.html's pre-paint script, and the theme setting offers light and high
contrast only. The desktop side menu labels its icons (a short name under each, the full name stays the tooltip and
the accessible name), the rail widens from 52 to 72 px for them, and «New chat» is its primary action. Accessibility
fixes from the QA: a translatable name for the composer's tools button, marketplace tabs that point at their panel, the
agent cards as a list (a grid without rows), and a memory switch without a nested checkbox. English strings for the new labels; the sign-in note gives the data rule in
production wording.

